      "authorType": "TOPIC",
      "content": "<p>Hi NVIDIA Team,</p>\n<p>Thank you for organizing this competition. While going through the competition details, I noticed an inconsistency in the Midpoint Cut-off Date between two sections:</p>\n<p><strong>In the Prizes section (Open Progress Prize):</strong></p>\n<blockquote>\n  <p>\"Awarded to the team with the highest leaderboard score as of the Midpoint Cut-off Date: April 9, 2026.\"</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><strong>In the Timeline section:</strong></p>\n<blockquote>\n  <p>\"April 16, 2026 - Midpoint Cut-off Date\"</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Could you please confirm which date is the correct Midpoint Cut-off Date for the Open Progress Prize?</p>\n<p>Thank you!</p>",
      "feedbackTrackingData": {},
