      "postDate": "2026-03-17T05:48:09.197Z",
      "rawMarkdown": "Hi NVIDIA Team,\n\nThank you for organizing this competition. While going through the competition details, I noticed an inconsistency in the Midpoint Cut-off Date between two sections:\n\n**In the Prizes section (Open Progress Prize):**\n> \"Awarded to the team with the highest leaderboard score as of the Midpoint Cut-off Date: April 9, 2026.\"\n\n**In the Timeline section:**\n> \"April 16, 2026 - Midpoint Cut-off Date\"\n\nCould you please confirm which date is the correct Midpoint Cut-off Date for the Open Progress Prize?\n\nThank you!",
